lex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini上线GIF生成功能，由Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash模型驱动</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c11dc5367b71d70767eeeca6d87bac41.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于11月21日为Gemini正式上线GIF生成功能，该功能由视频模型Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash驱动，支持用户通过自然语言描述直接生成循环动态图或表情包。用户可通过主聊天界面输入提示词，或在图像与视频工具中选择GIF格式进行创作。目前，该功能已面向所有Google AI订阅用户开放，并率先在美国、日本、韩国、澳大利亚、加拿大、英国、德国和法国的免费用户中启用。此外，谷歌于11月18日推出主攻复杂编程与科研的Gemini 4 Neon模型，该模型提供四档推理级别，API输入定价为每百万token 3美元，输出为15美元，缓存输入为0.15美元。Gemini 4 Neon现已向开发者、企业及Google AI Pro/Ultra订阅用户开放，旨在平衡推理能力、处理速度与成本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">调用量霸榜三十周，赚钱还差一关：国产模型的两张榜单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/661912c2918980694f530a5fd4b70dfc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">调用量霸榜三十周，赚钱还差一关：国产模型的两张榜单AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 23, 202632.5kOpenRouter 周榜呈现矛盾：11 月 16 至 22 日全球大模型总调用量 210 万亿 Token，环比增 8.25%。中国模型处理量连续第 30 周压过美国居首，但花钱榜的主角仍是海外模型。流量榜：前九占六席 厂商层面，DeepSeek、智谱、腾讯包揽前四：DeepSeek V4.1-Flash-1017 连续五周居首，周调用 65 万亿 Token。自家 V4.1 Flash 15.4 万亿居次。智谱 GLM 5.3 Flash 12.2 万亿第三。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵医疗健康大模型家族全面开源，发布四款覆盖多模态理解与医疗安全模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a6315d9ca34cd01d8d64b38d0f4ce411.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁百灵医疗健康大模型家族正式全面开源，推出LingSante-3.1-air-VL、LingSante-3.1-flash、LingSante Pulse及LingSante MedGuard四款模型。LingSante-3.1-air-VL为多模态模型，支持图文视频理解，总参数124B但激活参数仅5.5B，适配本地设备部署。LingSante-3.1-flash总参数560B，支持1M Token上下文，具备复杂医学推理与证据核验能力，适用于专业医疗机构。LingSante Pulse专注于150余项疾病的未来六年风险预测，LingSante MedGuard则负责医疗安全、合规及伦理风险防护。此次开源为开发者与医疗机构提供了涵盖健康信息理解、医学推理、风险预测及安全防护的完整AI工具箱，推动医疗AI技术在</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Thinking Machines Lab开源26.4B循环Transformer模型Inkling2Mini</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9f3c40ed08ed9a82daa602cab01372ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Thinking Machines Lab正式开源循环Transformer架构模型Inkling2Mini，该模型通过在中间12层对每个token循环运行三次，实现“多想少说”的推理优化。Inkling2Mini总参数26.4B，激活参数5.4B，支持文本与图像输入及1M token上下文窗口。在性能方面，该模型在ARC-AGI-2及SWE-Bench Pro v2Hard等基准测试中表现优异，超越同尺寸模型。部署方面，模型采用Apache 2.0许可，支持vLLM、Ollama及Unsloth 1-bit量化，最低仅需9GB内存即可在笔记本上运行。针对循环架构带来的可监测性担忧，官方开源了可变循环研究版本，并提供NDIF白盒访问指南，允许用户干预模型内部激活。该模型已登顶Hugging Face趋势榜，适用</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
